mnist-256-images-idx3-ubyte and mnist-256-labels-idx1-ubyte are the first
256 records of the MNIST training set, from the IDX files torchvision
downloads, https://ossci-datasets.s3.amazonaws.com/mnist/ ; the records
are unchanged and the headers' counts say 256.

