cifar10-256.bin is synthetic, not CIFAR-10: 256 records in the CIFAR-10
binary format generated by scripts/gen-cifar10-fixture.py. It carries the
repository's Apache-2.0 license.

The images/ directory is generated by scripts/gen-image-fixtures.py and
carries the repository's Apache-2.0 license. hymenoptera/ and style/
record their sources in their own NOTICE files.
